# Game content is versioned, except third-party marketplace packs
# (kept local only: size and marketplace redistribution terms).
# NOTE: trailing /* (not /) so the per-pack exceptions below can re-include.
Content/ThirdParty/*
# Exception: tiny first-party-critical assets live versioned even under ThirdParty.
!Content/ThirdParty/PotionMeshes/

# Auto-generated by the editor — never commit
Content/Collections/
Content/Developers/
Content/__ExternalActors__/
Content/__ExternalObjects__/
